&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:10.0pt;padding-right:0pt;line-height:16pt;"&gt;松山市南持田町に研修所を新築&lt;/p&gt;
